" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">15 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Mindsunder\" title=\"The Mindsunder\">The Mindsunder</a></b>, Disc locked optional end chest&#160;; <br /> Chance on every 3rd completion of <a href=\"/page/The_Mindsunder\" title=\"The Mindsunder\">The Mindsunder</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Enhancements\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Superior_Stability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Superior Stability\">Superior Stability</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Superior_Stability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Superior Stability\">Superior Stability</a>:</b> This armor grants a + 6 deflection bonus to AC and a + 6 resistance bonus to saves for characters of True Neutral alignment.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Protection\" title=\"Protection\">Protection +4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Protection\" title=\"Protection\">Protection +4</a>:</b> Passive: +4 <a href=\"/page/Deflection_bonus\" title=\"Deflection bonus\">Deflection bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +4</a>:</b> Passive: +4 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to Fortitude, Reflex, and Will Saving Throws.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">DR</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> 3/-</b>: Reduces all physical damage by 3.</span></span> 3/-</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Adamantine\" title=\"Adamantine\">Adamantine</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Adamantine\" title=\"Adamantine\">Adamantine</a>:</b> Found only in meteorites and the rarest of veins in magical areas, this ultrahard metal adds to the quality of a weapon or suit of armor. Light armor and shields made from <b>adamantine</b> grant their user damage reduction of 1/-.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mithral\" title=\"Mithral\">Mithral</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mithral\" title=\"Mithral\">Mithral</a>:</b> <b>Mithral</b> armor is one type lighter then normal. Arcane Spell Failure decreased by 10%. Maximum dexterity bonus increased by 2. Armor check penalty reduced by 3.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Suppressed_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Suppressed Power\">Suppressed Power</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Suppressed_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Suppressed Power\">Suppressed Power</a>: This psionic item is powerful, but you sense that it has not unlocked all of its secrets to you at this time.</span></span>\n<ul><li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">DR</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> 5/Epic</b>: Reduces  physical damage by 5, except from Epic aligned&#32;attacks.</span></span> 5/Epic</li>\n<li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Bashing\" title=\"Bashing\">Bashing</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bashing\" title=\"Bashing\">Bashing</a>:</b> This shield does an additional 1 to 6 damage when used to <a href=\"/page/Shield_bash\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shield bash\">shield bash</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li>Becomes <a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Equip</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\"><a href=\"/page/Suppressed_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Suppressed Power\">Suppressed Power</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;background:#CCEEFF\"><i>Long ago a champion of light and a champion of darkness faced off against one another in perfect balance. Neither could defeat the other until the champion of light sacrificed herself to mortally wound her foe. In the days that followed, this item was forged from the shattered remains of their shields.</i>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<ul><li>Superior Stability and Protection are both deflection bonuses to armor, also note that Shield of Faith is also. Resistance +4 and Superior Stability are also the same type of bonus. The resultant bonuses are that if your character's alignment is True Neutral, you'll get +6 to Saves and AC, otherwise you'll get +4.</li>\n<li>Post U14.1 Light and Darkness became Bound to Account on Equip. <br /></li>\n<li>Unsuppressed&#160;: <br /></li></ul>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Light_and_Darkness_(unsuppressed).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Light_and_Darkness_%28unsuppressed%29.png/315px-Light_and_Darkness_%28unsuppressed%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"315\" height=\"608\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Light_and_Darkness_%28unsuppressed%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816153829\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.087 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.130 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5041/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41070/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13892/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n124.85%  135.038     72 Template:IO\n100.00%  108.156      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  108.156      1 -total\n 97.18%  105.111      1 Template:Named_Shield\n 41.06%   44.408      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 40.03%   43.290      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 38.65%   41.804      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 37.71%   40.790      2 Template:InCategory\n 27.24%   29.464     12 Template:Popup\n 20.13%   21.771      3 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:10877-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816153829 and revision id 633251. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
